  "body": "Removal due to lack of inplementer and developer interest. The scrollPathIntoView method of CanvasRenderingContext2d has been in the spec for over a decade but no browser has shipped it. It is possible to implement similar behavior using existing APIs.\n\nFixes https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8216\n\nThis is a new PR based on an abandoned one: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8229\n\n- [X] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium\n   * Firefox\n- [X] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * There is an existing test that the feature is removed, which Chromium based-browsers currently fail. There are some WPT to test the feature that I will remove.\n- [X] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: Removal bug: https://issues.chromium.org/issues/352520734\n   * Gecko: Bug to close: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1120401\n   * WebKit: Bug to close: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=149987\n [X] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/34845\n- [X] The top of this comment includes a [clear commit message](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/COMMITTING.md) to use. <!-- If you created this PR from a single commit, Github copied its message. Otherwise, you need to add a commit message yourself. -->\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10482/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 15, 2024, 8:58 PM UTC (4ac6c12)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10482/e7ef381...4ac6c12/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 15, 2024, 8:58 PM UTC (4ac6c12)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10482/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 15, 2024, 8:58 PM UTC (4ac6c12)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10482/e7ef381...4ac6c12/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 15, 2024, 8:58 PM UTC (4ac6c12)\">diff</a> )",
